@startuml iati-message-queue-service-and-apps-overview
scale 2000*1600

skinparam noteFontSize 10
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

' === Line status convention ===
' Connections that are NOT YET IMPLEMENTED are drawn grey and dotted,
' with a grey label, e.g.:
'   A -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-> B : <color:#AAAAAA>label</color>
' NOTE: <color> does not span \n line breaks, so each line of a multi-line
' label must be wrapped separately, e.g.:
'   <color:#AAAAAA>line1</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>line2</color>

!include <azure/AzureCommon>
!include <azure/Compute/AzureFunction>
!include <azure/Containers/AzureContainerInstance>
!include <azure/Integration/AzureServiceBus>
!include <azure/Databases/AzureDatabaseForPostgreSQL>
!include <azure/Storage/AzureBlobStorage>


AzureServiceBus(IATIMessageQueueService, "\nIATI Message Queue Service", "iati-mq")

AzureContainerInstance(BulkDataServiceApp, "\nBulk Data Service App", "bulk-data-service-INSTANCE")

AzureFunction(DataDownloader, "\n<color:#AAAAAA>Data Downloader</color>", "")

AzureBlobStorage(BulkDataServiceWebsite, "\nBulk Data Service Website", "bulk-data.iatistadnard.org")

AzureDatabaseForPostgreSQL(BDSPersistentStorage, "Bulk Data Service Persistent Data Storage", "")

AzureFunction(ActivityStream, "\nIATI Activity Stream", "")

AzureDatabaseForPostgreSQL(ActivityStreamPersistentStorage, "Activity Stream Persistent Data Storage", "")

component SuiteCRM

component "Dashboard" as Dashboard

note left of BulkDataServiceApp
App which coordinates the checking of dataset downloads
end note

note right of SuiteCRM
Connections from an app to the Message Queue Service are denoted by edges that begin either with **publish:** or **consume:**. The edge description lists the action type and the <<""topic"">> or <<""subscription"">> name.
end note


SuiteCRM -down-> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-topic"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\nREPORTING_ORG_CREATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_DELETED

Dashboard -( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-sub-dashboard-[dev|prod]"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\nREPORTING_ORG_CREATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_DELETED

Dashboard -( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-dataset-check-results-sub-dashboard-[dev|prod]"">>\nDATASET_CHECK_RESULT

ActivityStream --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-sub-dashboard-[dev|prod]"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_CREATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_DELETED</color>

ActivityStream --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-dataset-check-results-sub-dashboard-[dev|prod]"">>\nDATASET_CHECK_RESULT

ActivityStream <-> ActivityStreamPersistentStorage : read/save state

BulkDataServiceApp -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-> IATIMessageQueueService : <color:#AAAAAA>**publish**:</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-download-request-queue-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-high-priority-download-request-queue-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_DOWNLOAD_REQUEST</color>

BulkDataServiceApp --> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-dataset-check-results-topic-[dev|prod]"">>\nDATASET_CHECK_RESULT

BulkDataServiceApp -[#AAAAAA,dotted]up--( IATIMessageQueueService : <color:#AAAAAA>**consume**:</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-registry-changes-sub-bds-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_CREATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_UPDATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_DELETED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_CREATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>REPORTING_ORG_DELETED</color>

BulkDataServiceApp -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-( IATIMessageQueueService : <color:#AAAAAA>**consume**:</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-download-results-sub-bds-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_DOWNLOAD_ATTEMPT_RESULT</color>

BulkDataServiceApp --> BulkDataServiceWebsite : upload bulk ZIP

BulkDataServiceApp <--> BDSPersistentStorage : read/save state

DataDownloader -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-( IATIMessageQueueService : <color:#AAAAAA>**consume**:</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-download-request-queue-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-high-priority-download-request-queue-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_DOWNLOAD_REQUEST</color>

DataDownloader -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-> IATIMessageQueueService : <color:#AAAAAA>**publish**:</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA><<""iati-mq-dataset-download-results-topic-[dev|prod]"">></color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>DATASET_DOWNLOAD_ATTEMPT_RESULT</color>

DataDownloader -[#AAAAAA,dotted]-> BulkDataServiceWebsite : <color:#AAAAAA>upload individual</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>IATI datasets</color>\n<color:#AAAAAA>(XML and ZIP)</color>

legend right
**Line styles**
|<color:#000000>──────</color> | Implemented (black, solid) |
|<color:#AAAAAA>┈┈┈┈┈┈</color> | Not yet implemented (grey, dotted) |
----
**Last updated:** 2026-06-25
endlegend

@enduml
